(439,1,'2025-12-21 10:34:49','2025-12-21 08:34:49','Previous slide\n														Next slide\n								<figure><img src=\"https://climaticpro.ro/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Gree-pulsar-inverter-www.climafresh.ro-7.png\" alt=\"Gree-pulsar-inverter-www.climafresh.ro-7\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://climaticpro.ro/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/22_05_2015_Multifilter.jpg\" alt=\"climaticpro gree multifilter\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://climaticpro.ro/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/midea-banner1.jpeg\" alt=\"midea\" /></figure>			\n				<a href=\"/produs/montare-instalare-aer-conditionat/\" aria-label=\"Plata in rate\">\n								</a>\n									<h3>\n						<a href=\"/produs/montare-instalare-aer-conditionat/\">\n							Plata in rate						</a>\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Plata in maxim 12 rate prin TBI Bank					</p>\n									<h3>\n							Livrare gratuita						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						* Pentru  Bucuresti si Ilfov. La aparatele instalate de noi					</p>\n									<h3>\n							Garantia serviciilor						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Montarea executata de profesionisti					</p>\n									<h3>\n							Consultanta 						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Consultanta telefonica sau la locatie					</p>\n					<h2>Rezerva instalarea direct din calendar</h2>				\n		<p>Dupa ce alegeti data si ora continuati cu comanda pentru a finaliza rezervarea. Trebuie sa adaugati in cos Montare / instalare aer conditionat daca deja aveti Aparatul de aer conditionat sau continuati cu adaugarea unui alt produs.</p>[jckwds]		\n					\n.comparative-wrapper {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 20px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-family: \'Segoe UI\', sans-serif;\n  margin-bottom: 30px;\n}\n.comparative-card {\n  flex: 1 1 320px;\n  max-width: 360px;\n  border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);\n  transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n  background-color: #fff;\n}\n.comparative-card:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-5px);\n}\n.comparative-card img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: auto;\n  display: block;\n}\n.comparative-card .card-body {\n  padding: 20px;\n}\n.comparative-card h2 {\n  font-size: 1.15em;\n  color: #2b2b2b;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n/* BTU tags */\n.btu-tag-group {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 8px;\n  margin: 10px 0 18px 0;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n.btu-tag {\n  background: #f8f8f8;\n  border: 1px solid #ccc;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 6px 12px;\n  font-size: 0.85em;\n  color: #333;\n  text-align: center;\n  flex: 1 1 calc(33.333% - 8px);\n  text-decoration: none;\n  transition: all 0.25s ease;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n.btu-tag small {\n  display: block;\n  color: #d32f2f;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  font-size: 0.9em;\n}\n.btu-tag:hover {\n  background-color: #0066cc;\n  color: #fff;\n  border-color: #0066cc;\n}\n.btu-tag:hover small {\n  color: #fff;\n}\n.btu-tag.active {\n  background-color: #0066cc;\n  color: #fff;\n  border-color: #0066cc;\n}\n.btu-tag.active small {\n  color: #fff;\n}\n.comparative-card .price {\n  color: #d32f2f;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  font-size: 1.15em;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n.comparative-card .features {\n  font-size: 0.95em;\n  color: #444;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n  line-height: 1.6em;\n}\n.comparative-card .highlight {\n  background: #f6fafd;\n  padding: 8px 10px;\n  border-left: 3px solid #0066cc;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  font-size: 0.9em;\n  color: #0066cc;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n.comparative-card .btn-group a {\n  display: inline-block;\n  margin: 5px 0;\n  padding: 10px 18px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  font-size: 0.95em;\n}\n.comparative-card .btn-primary {\n  background-color: #0066cc;\n  color: #fff;\n}\n.comparative-card .btn-success {\n  background-color: #43a047;\n  color: #fff;\n}\n\n  <!-- Card Midea Xtreme Fresh -->\n    <a href=\"/produs/aparat-de-aer-conditionat-midea-xtreme-fresh-msagbu-12hrfn8-